    {
      "command": "EVENT_COMMENT",
      "args": {
        "text": "- i was thinking rhythm game originally, but the other rec events are short, so shouldnt this be short too?\n- maybe a shmup-esque where you have to hit certain tokens to 'make' a performance?\n- depending on the tokens hit, you get certain buffs?",
